/gear" &gt;stuff&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="timeline"&gt;&#10; Timeline&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#timeline"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Not like a hoarder. (I suppose this is relative&amp;hellip;) I don&amp;rsquo;t believe I have a &lt;em&gt;problem&lt;/em&gt; (Doesn&amp;rsquo;t everyone who has a problem say that?) If I do have a problem, it started in earnest around 1984-85 when I got my 1st &amp;ldquo;real&amp;rdquo; &lt;a href="https://www.nonpunctual.org/gear/moog-liberation/#pitch" &gt;synthesizer&lt;/a&gt;. So it&amp;rsquo;s an honest, long-standing problem.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>